{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42031","headline":"甲子岁罢吉水县过锺陵时暮春维舟江渚谒柴太尉席上作 · 李中","name":"甲子岁罢吉水县过锺陵时暮春维舟江渚谒柴太尉席上作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公侯延驻暂踟蹰，况值风光三月初。\n乱落杯盘花片小，静笼池阁柳阴疎。\n舟维南浦程虽阻，饮预西园兴有余。\n却笑田家门下客，当时容易叹车鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}